Mozilla Public License 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two crates compiled into the binaries are under the MPL-2.0:

  option-ext 0.2.0
  uluru 3.1.0

Both are used unmodified, as published to the crates.io registry at exactly
those versions, which is where their source form may be obtained. No file
covered by the MPL has been altered, so there is no modified source to publish.
The full license text is in licenses/MPL-2.0.txt.

lightningcss is also MPL-2.0 but is a build-time dependency of Vite and is not
distributed, so it is not listed here.

