Apache License 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Eleven crates compiled into the binaries are offered under the Apache-2.0 alone
rather than as a choice including MIT:

  alacritty_terminal 0.26.0   miette 7.6.0          prost-derive 0.13.5
  gix-imara-diff 0.2.5        miette-derive 7.6.0   prost-types 0.13.5
  similar 2.7.0               prost 0.13.5          sync_wrapper 1.0.2
